flowchart TD
  accTitle: Mandatory assistant delivery prerequisite
  accDescr: Admission and final delivery require a matching published active ready assistant and enabled runtime. Setup never automatically replays held work.
  R[Reviewed customer action] --> M{Exact business, channel, account and surface?}
  M -->|No| B[Block or hold]
  M -->|Yes| A{Runtime enabled and assigned assistant published, active and ready?}
  A -->|No| B
  A -->|Yes| Q[Admit reviewed work]
  Q --> F{Recheck assistant and provider before delivery}
  F -->|Not ready| B
  F -->|Ready| P[Provider delivery attempt]
  B --> E[Explicit review and recovery required]
  E --> N[Setup never automatically replays held work]
